  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Is this the library? I wanted the library, the one on the avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, hon, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. You've got us instead. Which number did you dial?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:49:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I looked it up in my book. It's got a four-oh-one on it, but my daughter says there's a new area code now. Is that why I got you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, four-oh-one is still ours here in Rhode Island. You probably just got a digit off, that happens. [pause] Are you all right there? I hear something hissing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's my iron, I'm doing a shirt. The steam does that. Hold on, let me set it down. Okay. So what do I do, dial the four-oh-one again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but I'd look the library up fresh, the number in an old book might be out of date. Or I can tell you the library is on Spring Street, if you'd rather walk over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring Street, that's right. Well, I don't understand it, but thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. You take care now."
    }
  ],
